<section class="aq-section aq-section--alt aq-urs-gate-sec"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Decide before your requirements (URS) are approved</h2></header><div class="aq-fold" id="fold-3"><div class="aq-urs-gate" style="--cols:11"><span class="aq-urs-gate__axis" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-urs-gate__water"></span></span><ol class="aq-urs-gate__list"><li class="aq-urs-gate__item" style="--c:1"><span class="aq-urs-gate__stem" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-urs-gate__node"></span></span><span class="aq-urs-gate__n" aria-hidden="true"><span>01</span></span><h3 class="aq-urs-gate__t">Product mix in five years</h3><p class="aq-urs-gate__d">Generation and headers sized for planned lines, expansion written into the URS.</p></li><li class="aq-urs-gate__item is-low" style="--c:3"><span class="aq-urs-gate__stem" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-urs-gate__node"></span></span><span class="aq-urs-gate__n" aria-hidden="true"><span>02</span></span><h3 class="aq-urs-gate__t">USP, Ph. Eur. or both</h3><p class="aq-urs-gate__d">Both: cheap at design, costly later.</p></li><li class="aq-urs-gate__item" style="--c:5"><span class="aq-urs-gate__stem" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-urs-gate__node"></span></span><span class="aq-urs-gate__n" aria-hidden="true"><span>03</span></span><h3 class="aq-urs-gate__t">Loop sanitization route</h3><p class="aq-urs-gate__d">Natural polypropylene (PP) is rated 0 to 80 °C, and its pressure rating falls as it heats.</p><a class="aq-urs-gate__link" href="#sys-storage#sanitization" data-wp="sys-storage#sanitization">Chemical, hot water or UV</a></li><li class="aq-urs-gate__item is-low aq-fold-x" style="--c:7"><span class="aq-urs-gate__stem" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-urs-gate__node"></span></span><span class="aq-urs-gate__n" aria-hidden="true"><span>04</span></span><h3 class="aq-urs-gate__t">Canadian feed water</h3><p class="aq-urs-gate__d">Near freezing in winter, over 20 °C in summer; membranes sized for the coldest month.</p><a class="aq-urs-gate__link" href="#sys-pretreatment" data-wp="sys-pretreatment">Pretreatment</a></li><li class="aq-urs-gate__item aq-fold-x" style="--c:9"><span class="aq-urs-gate__stem" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-urs-gate__node"></span></span><span class="aq-urs-gate__n" aria-hidden="true"><span>05</span></span><h3 class="aq-urs-gate__t">Shutdown windows</h3><p class="aq-urs-gate__d">Duplex trains and isolable sections let you service without stopping every line.</p></li></ol><div class="aq-urs-gate__gate" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-urs-gate__bar"></span><span class="aq-urs-gate__mark">Approved</span><span class="aq-urs-gate__word">URS</span></div></div><button type="button" class="aq-fold__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fold-3" data-more="Show all 5 decisions">Show all 5 decisions</button></div></div></section>
